      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you are right. One of the ones which immediately sticks out is `inputProfilePathOnHost` which has a 1:1 mapping to java library. One of the hacks I have for now is to reset these values to nil before every `dexpreopt` invocation to nil. https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/build/soong/+/2929189/1/java/dexpreopt.go#276\n\nI would like to make this operation stateless. I will be doing this cleanup in a followup CL.",
